                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                  "width": 1150,
                  "height": 174.94,
                  "content": "Make discovery feel as engaging as the films themselves. Large imagery sets the mood, while focused navigation, useful filters, and clear information help people find their next watch.",
